All options are non-refundable after 24 hours before pickup but can be canceled up to 24 hours in advance. Pickup at Central Station (Railway Colonnade Dr, Haymarket NSW 2000). Drop-off at Sydney Opera House (Bennelong Point, Sydney NSW 2000). Supplier: HD Cars Global (ID: 102634)—they're highly rated for Sydney transfers.

